    "detailed_description": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br><strong>This game was made by new-hires to Byking Inc. during an introductory training period.<br>We ask for your understanding, for issues arising from certain operating environments,<br>or for any flaws or inadequacies present in the final product.<br><strong>This game was made for local play,<br>but supports online via Steam Remote Play Together.</strong><br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br><strong>*This title cannot be played using a keyboard or mouse*<br>*Four controllers are required to play, and this title is for local play only*</strong><br><br>Are you ready?! Make some noise (and some enemies) in this action-packed party shooter for 4! <br>Utilize your unique energy shots, power-up your attacks with an array of pick-ups, and get set to take down the competition!!<br><br>4 players enter the arena\u2026but the Curse of the Golden Idol demands that only 1 may leave. \u2026will it be you?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/82faeaf0d0f798374ca70a2dee18f130.avif?t=1743409163\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37A 4-Way Battle Royale Shooter Extravaganza!\ud83d\udd37</h2>You get a gun, they get a gun. Everybody gets a gun!<br>Shoot your way to victory and be the last Hunter standing!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/c88009da0d0fcd6cbb29fb2195440b72.avif?t=1743409163\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37Watch Your Back Out There!\ud83d\udd37</h2>Who to aim for and when to do it, careful consideration of your and your enemies\u2019 <br>resources could nab you victory\u2026or see you lose it all!<br>Can you make the right decisions under pressure? Only time will tell\u2026<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/6596e6d7310517f89e9b09bc4e4df7b8.avif?t=1743409163\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37The Golden Idol\u2019s Curse!<br>\ud83d\udd37</h2>ime Hunters are equipped with special guns\u2026and special bullets. Bounce shots off walls to catch your foes off-guard!<br><br>And oh, what\u2019s this? The Golden Idol demands a good fight! Pick up glowing, <br>Golden Idols scattered round the arena, and augment your shots with various buffs for maximum mayhem!<br><br><strong>\uff1eBOMB Shot\uff1c</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/35f99bd31a4af79109fc3464abafb649.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/35f99bd31a4af79109fc3464abafb649.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/35f99bd31a4af79109fc3464abafb649.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Penetrates walls and SHIELDs. Use it for explosive results!<br><br><strong>\uff1eBIG Shot\uff1c</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5069531508970af05c971d06dc44c6cc.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5069531508970af05c971d06dc44c6cc.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5069531508970af05c971d06dc44c6cc.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Size matters. Fire away and leave them with nowhere to run!<br><br><strong>\uff1e3-WAY Shot\uff1c</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/f4b2708de9664ea31f51fcfa850266c3.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/f4b2708de9664ea31f51fcfa850266c3.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/f4b2708de9664ea31f51fcfa850266c3.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A 3-WAY spreadshot. Never let them know your next move!<br><br><strong>\uff1eBOUNCE Shot\uff1c</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5824ac270717bb7c25363c3dd7157f42.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5824ac270717bb7c25363c3dd7157f42.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/5824ac270717bb7c25363c3dd7157f42.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>More BOUNCE, more mileage. Ricochets 3 times for off-the-wall fun!<br><br><strong>\uff1eSHIELD\uff1c</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/d7ee596341e06bca1050beedbed0beab.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/d7ee596341e06bca1050beedbed0beab.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/d7ee596341e06bca1050beedbed0beab.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Protect yourself from devastation...once! (Look out for BOMBs though!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37Two Buffs are Better than One!!\ud83d\udd37</h2>Does the power of the Golden Idol know no bounds!? (2, the bounds is 2)<br>Grab 2 different buffs, and reap the benefits of both at once. One Hunter\u2019s meat is another Hunter\u2019s <br>3-WAY explosive BOMB Shot to the face, so pick your poison and start a-blastin\u2019!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/949a205939d22267a28c3d3560e3afa4.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/949a205939d22267a28c3d3560e3afa4.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/949a205939d22267a28c3d3560e3afa4.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The fabled BIG + BOMB Shot!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/56fa28abd75595c0519cd1d25e242bf4.poster.avif?t=1743409163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/56fa28abd75595c0519cd1d25e242bf4.webm?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/56fa28abd75595c0519cd1d25e242bf4.mp4?t=1743409163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The legendary 3-WAY + BOMB Shot!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37A Smart Hunter\u2019s a Happy Hunter!\ud83d\udd37</h2>Whoa okay trigger-happy, hold on. Shooting up the place will only get you so far! <br>Keep track of your dash and remaining buff counts, and those of rival Hunters, for the greatest chance at success!<br><br>Got all that? Alright. Now go catch \u2018em with their pants down, and have a good Time Hunting!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467410/extras/021f99cbd843beea4d3043053bc118df.avif?t=1743409163\" /></span></strong>",
